---
import type { FrontSearchEntry } from '../../data/front-search-index';

interface Props {
  entries: FrontSearchEntry[];
}

const { entries } = Astro.props;
---

<section
  class="search-workspace page-width"
  data-front-search
  data-search-index={JSON.stringify(entries)}
>
  <form class="search-form" action="" method="get" role="search" data-search-form>
    <label for="site-search">搜索当前网站</label>
    <div>
      <input
        id="site-search"
        name="q"
        type="search"
        autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="输入剧目、城市或页面名称"
        data-search-input
      />
      <button type="submit">搜索</button>
    </div>
    <p>搜索范围：炎国版表站 · 不包含 1091 历史快照</p>
  </form>
  <div class="search-feedback" data-search-feedback aria-live="polite">
    <p>输入关键词以查找场次、剧目与网站页面。</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="search-results" data-search-results></ol>
  <noscript>
    <div class="search-noscript" role="status">
      <h2>搜索需要启用 JavaScript</h2>
      <p>当前页面不会发送查询或加载远端服务。您仍可使用主导航浏览本季演出、历史演出与剧团信息。</p>
    </div>
  </noscript>
</section>

<script>
  import { initFrontSearch } from '../../scripts/front-search';

  initFrontSearch();
</script>
